used by billions of users.

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:07.110
This allows you to deploy it
and deliver high-performing APIs

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:11.250
across 24 regions and
73 zones with caching

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:14.550
across 93 points of presence.

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:17.790
It provides multiple layers
of security for your APIs,

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.530
eliminating the
need to integrate

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:22.410
